+- AVEVA PDMS RVM (`FileFormat.RvmText`/`RvmBinary`), Universal 3D (`FileFormat.Universal3D`),
+  AMF (`FileFormat.AMF`), and HTML5/Aspose 3D Web viewer export (`FileFormat.HTML5`) are declared
+  as public `FileFormat` static fields with option-class support (`RvmLoadOptions`/
+  `RvmSaveOptions`, `U3dLoadOptions`/`U3dSaveOptions`, `AmfSaveOptions`, `Html5SaveOptions`), but
+  none of them is wired into the format dispatcher that `Scene.Open()`/`Scene.Save()` use —
+  calling either method with a `.rvm`, `.u3d`, `.amf`, or `.html` path throws
+  `ArgumentException: Unsupported file format` before any format-specific code runs. No reader or
+  writer implementation exists for any of these four formats anywhere in the codebase. `RvmFormat`
+  additionally exposes a `LoadAttributes` method that throws `NotImplementedException`, but this
+  is secondary to the format being entirely unreachable through the public API.
 - Text watermarking is not currently functional in this FOSS build.
